<title>POLAND: PBR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 24.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 24.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.80 vs    3.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    6.20 vs    8.19</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 11.18 vs   15.36</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	14.35 vs   19.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 24.89 vs   14.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   47.22 vs   35.68</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 89.85 vs   78.68</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     188.34 vs  159.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
